---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { updatedLabel } from '../lib/data';

const path = '/board-and-ned';
const updated = updatedLabel(path);
---
<Base path={path}>
<div>
<div style="padding:clamp(48px,7vw,80px) clamp(20px,4vw,60px) clamp(40px,5vw,60px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14)">
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:30px"><div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#8a5a3c">04 · BOARD &amp; NON-EXECUTIVE</div><div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#5c5d51">LAST UPDATED {updated}</div></div>
<h1 style="margin:0;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(38px,5.4vw,72px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.025em;max-width:17ch;text-wrap:balance">Board-level judgement from someone still <em style="color:#8a5a3c">in the work</em>.</h1>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px;margin-top:40px;align-items:flex-start">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.62;color:#3c3d33;max-width:700px;text-wrap:pretty">I take a small number of positions a year, weighted to businesses where product, technology and now AI decide the outcome. I'm useful in the room because I'm still building the week before the board meeting.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 22px;align-items:center;align-self:stretch">
<a href="/contact" style="flex:none;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;background:#15160f;color:#f5f2ea;padding:14px 24px;min-height:48px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:500">Book 30 minutes</a>
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#5c5d51">2–4 SEATS HELD · STANDARD NED TERMS</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="padding:clamp(46px,6vw,70px) clamp(20px,4vw,60px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14);background:#eeeade;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:clamp(28px,4vw,60px)">
<div style="max-width:320px"><h2 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.1">What I actually contribute</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#5c5d51">Beyond governance and the usual board hygiene.</p></div>
<div style="grid-column:span 2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:26px;min-width:0">
<div><h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">Product and roadmap pressure</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3c3d33">The uncomfortable questions about what's being built and why, asked early enough to matter.</p></div>
<div><h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">AI reality-check</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3c3d33">Where it genuinely changes the cost base, where it's theatre, and what the board should expect to see by when.</p></div>
<div><h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">Exit readiness</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3c3d33">Been through it as founder and investor. Most of the value is decided two years before the process starts.</p></div>
<div><h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">Senior hiring</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3c3d33">Sitting in on CTO, CPO and head-of-engineering hires, and telling you honestly what you're buying.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="padding:clamp(46px,6vw,70px) clamp(20px,4vw,60px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px 40px;align-items:center">
<div><h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.02em">Current availability</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#3c3d33;max-width:560px">Taking enquiries for one further board seat through the rest of the year. Also open to a fractional product &amp; AI leadership retainer — a day or two a month with a CEO who needs the plan pressure-tested.</p></div>
<a href="/contact" style="flex:none;text-decoration:none;background:#15160f;color:#f5f2ea;padding:14px 28px;min-height:48px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:500">Book 30 minutes</a>
</div>
</div>
</Base>
